flowchart TD
    trigger([Material work or possible missing context]) --> scale{Trivial and fully specified?}
    scale -->|yes| nearest[Read nearest guidance and target file]
    scale -->|no| guidance[Read one native guide, routed context, and active tracker slice]
    guidance --> evidence[Inspect relevant code, config, git state, and history]
    evidence --> ledger[Separate verified facts, recorded decisions, and unknowns]
    ledger --> material{Does an unknown materially change the result?}
    material -->|no| proceed[Follow evidence and established project patterns]
    material -->|yes| searchable{Can project evidence answer it?}
    searchable -->|yes| evidence
    searchable -->|no| owner[Ask the owner with options and pause]
    owner --> record[Record the answer in its canonical home]
    record --> proceed
    nearest --> proceed
    proceed --> learned{New durable knowledge?}
    learned -->|project| projectContext[Update docs/PROJECT-CONTEXT.md]
    learned -->|feature| tracker[Update the feature tracker]
    learned -->|fleet| globalRecord[Update the matching global record]
    learned -->|no or session-only| finish([Finish without extra documentation])
    projectContext --> finish
    tracker --> finish
    globalRecord --> finish
